<text top="1233" left="117" width="363" height="25" font="4"><b>A. SELF ASSESSMENT TESTS - KEYS</b></text>
<text top="1235" left="117" width="125" height="22" font="5"><b>Unit 1 p. 23-24</b></text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="246" height="22" font="6">A. 1. T,   2. F,  3. F,  4. T,  5. T</text>
